# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Licensed assets stay licensed (brief §1). Synty packs live only here and are
# never committed. Anything under Assets/ that references them must be
# presentation-side; the simulation and its tests must not depend on them.
/Assets/Synty/
/Assets/Synty.meta
*.unitypackage
